{
    "background_story": "Cakes was a mystical cat with eyes as golden as the rutile crystals found in the ancient mountains. Legend had it that Cakes possessed the essence of the crystals, which granted her the power to sense the deepest desires of those around her. Her owner, a wise old jeweler, would often take Cakes to his workshop, where she'd sit amidst the sparkling gemstones, as if absorbing their secrets. Whenever someone held a piece of jewelry containing rutile, Cakes would mysteriously appear, as if drawn by an unseen force. Her presence was said to amplify the crystal's energy, imbuing the wearer with confidence and clarity. People would whisper that Cakes was a guardian of the rutile's mystical properties, and that her enigmatic presence was a blessing to those who sought wisdom.",
